<!--
  ARCHITECTURE.md §1 Wave A, sub-wave A2 — DEPLOY 1 of 2 (remove references + destructive delete).

  Regular components: the 3 Apex classes and the FlexiPage that referenced the two
  OLD-cased blocked fields, edited to REMOVE those references (SOQL select field,
  DTO assignment read, test-factory field assignment, FlexiPage spanning fieldInstance).
  These deploy FIRST; then the paired --post-destructive-changes manifest
  (destructiveChangesPost-a2.xml) deletes the now-unreferenced OLD-cased fields.

  Deleting a field is blocked by field ID (case-insensitive), so the reference had to be
  physically removed here — a re-case alone does not clear the dependency.

  Deploy:
    sf project deploy start \
      --manifest manifest/wave-a-case-recase/package-a2-remove.xml \
      --post-destructive-changes manifest/wave-a-case-recase/destructiveChangesPost-a2.xml \
      --target-org DPEG-Acq-5 --test-level RunLocalTests --wait 30
-->
